"n-prev-s1":{"x":1520,"y":0,"w":520,"text":"How to use it: press Play on the live role preview. Every rail destination works — Overview, Ready to publish, Content library, Updates, Course codes and Help & support — and changes carry across screens until you reload. Dashed “Scenario handoff” boxes stand in for the Academic Reviewer’s and Super Admin’s decisions; they are not part of the product.","page":"preview","fill":"blue"},
"n-prev-s2":{"x":2120,"y":0,"w":520,"text":"Other pages hold inspection boards: the same Main.dc.html opened at a fixed state. Owned screens (CM-01 to CM-09 at 1440), Responsive (1024, 768, 375), Publication states, Correction states, Lists & course codes, Shared surfaces (borrowed XS until the Shared Surfaces workstream delivers).","page":"preview","fill":"gray"},
"n-prev-s4":{"x":2120,"y":760,"w":520,"text":"Final role design for your visual acceptance: every Content Manager screen, CM-01 to CM-09 with the correction detail and the public-page handoff, now uses the one Refined B publishing-desk design, at 1440, 1024, 768 and 375 and on every state board. COVERAGE.md lists each screen and state as Redesigned or Reviewed and unchanged.","page":"preview","fill":"blue"},
"n-prev-s3":{"x":1520,"y":760,"w":520,"text":"Sample data as of Thursday 27 August 2026: v46 fixtures where they exist, the rest marked illustrative in SCENARIOS.json. Publishing and releasing never give anyone access; corrections reach the live record only when the Super Admin releases them.","page":"preview","fill":"teal"}},
